## Session Context (Overte MCP)

You have access to an Overte (open-source VR/metaverse) domain-server administration server with 3 core tools + a companion React dashboard.

**Before starting work:**
1. Check domain-server status: `overte_domain_status(host="localhost", port=40100)`
2. List available tools via MCP discovery

**At end of work:**
- Any entity spawns or script injections should be verified against the live domain
- Update docs/CHANGELOG.md if adding new capabilities
